#. macro: <noun-en ENpcResident 2 $n5 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ENpcResident, form = 2, row = number parameter 5, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/FesBkcRecomplete_00716:TEXT_FESBKCRECOMPLETE_00716_YESNOCHECK_000_002:1"
msgid "If you proceed, the following quest(s) will be rendered incomplete:<br>  <sheet Quest $n1 0><br><if ($n2 == 0)><else>  <sheet Quest $n2 0><br></if><if ($n3 == 0)><else>  <sheet Quest $n3 0><br></if><if ($n4 == 0)><else>The following NPC(s) will become unavailable for trade until you have completed the requisite quest again:<br>  <title-case><noun-en ENpcResident 2 $n4 1 1></title-case><br></if><if ($n5 == 0)><else>  <title-case><noun-en ENpcResident 2 $n5 1 1></title-case><br></if>Please ensure that you have sufficient time, and be advised that you will not receive quest rewards via this feature.<br><br>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「シーズナルクエストリプレイ」を実行する
#. de: Saisonalen Auftrag wiederholen
#. fr: Lancer le rappel événementiel
